    "text": "A tower subtends angles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></math> respectively at points, <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><mi>C</mi></math> (all points lying on the same side on a horizontal line through the foot of the tower), then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
